        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_92df47084cd94c1c9323fb3cfe521487",
      "statement": "Simplicity and small, understandable changes are reliability practices: purposeful APIs, clear responsibilities, compatible interfaces, and incremental releases reduce accidental complexity and narrow the causes of regressions.",
